<title>USA: Trico says share increase allows 2-1 split.</title>
<headline>Trico says share increase allows 2-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trico Marine Services Inc said Tuesday shareholders at its annual meeting voted to increase the company's authorized common stock to 40 million shares from 15 million, permitting a two-for-one stock split that will be payable June 9 to shareholders of record as of May 23.</p>
<p>Trico provides marine support services to the oil and gas industry in the Gulf of Mexico and Brazil.</p>
</text>
